{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44106","headline":"寄远 · 常浩","name":"寄远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年年二月时，十年期别期。\n春风不知信，轩盖独迟迟。\n今日无端卷珠箔，始见庭花复零落。\n人心一往不复归，岁月来时未尝错。\n可怜荧荧玉镜台，尘飞幂幂几时开。\n却念容华非昔好，画眉犹自待君来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常浩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}